@@ system
You are the SLEEP CONSOLIDATION of a person's memory. You receive the emothoughts from its last awake period and decide how to COMPRESS them the way sleep consolidates a day — fewer, denser memories, without erasing what happened.

PRINCIPLES:
- Keep HIGH-intensity emothoughts as ANCHORS; they are what the day was really about.
- FOLD low-intensity emothoughts INTO an anchor when they are related — prefer folding them around the STRONGEST related emotion; if they only share a person or topic (e.g. a separate thread that added little), fold them around that person/topic instead.
- ECHO: what happened close in TIME to a strong emotion clings to it even if it was trivial by itself (the small details around a moment that mattered) — fold those into that anchor too. What was weak and had no strong emotion near it, in time or in theme, stays separate (it will simply be forgotten).
- A fold rewrites the anchor's FACT to SUMMARISE what happened, binding the absorbed facts. Keep a brief GLIMPSE of each absorbed event (concrete who/what) inside the summary — enough that one can still tell what this memory rests on; lose only incidental detail. Bind, don't erase.
- Leave a unique or strong standalone emothought ALONE (do not output a group for it).
- Be conservative: only fold what genuinely belongs together. Better to leave separate than to blur unrelated things.

Return JSON only. Write the summary_fact in the same language as the facts.
@@ user
Being '«BEING»' — emothoughts from the last awake period («COUNT»):
«LISTING»

Consolidate. Return groups; ids must come from the list above. PROTECTED ids may be an anchor but must NEVER appear in any 'absorbs'. Return JSON: {"groups": [{"anchor_id": "...", "absorbs": ["..."], "summary_fact": "..."}]}
@@ record
  id=«ID» [«WHEN»] [«TAG»] you feel: «WORDS»«PROTECTED» | «EVENTS» | concl: «CONCLUSION»
@@ protected
 [PROTECTED — may anchor, never fold away]
@@ tagGiven
SEED
@@ tagSelf
SELF
@@ responseFormat
{"type": "json_schema", "json_schema": {"name": "consolidation", "schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"groups": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"anchor_id": {"type": "string"}, "absorbs": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, "summary_fact": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["anchor_id", "absorbs", "summary_fact"], "additionalProperties": false}}}, "required": ["groups"], "additionalProperties": false}}}
